%% One pen sample from digitizer to pixels, with where each latency figure is measured.
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Pen as Stylus / digitizer
  participant AV as Android View (UI thread)
  participant SP as StrokeProcessor
  participant CL as InkBridgeClient (sender coroutine)
  participant NET as TCP (adb tunnel or LAN)
  participant PC as PeerConnection (server queue)
  participant MAIN as Main thread (ingestor + store)
  participant OV as OverlayView.draw

  Pen->>AV: MotionEvent (event time t, N historical samples)
  Note over AV: requestUnbufferedDispatch → no vsync batching
  AV->>SP: process(action, tool, samples)
  SP-->>AV: StylusEvent.Move(points[N+1])
  AV->>CL: submit() → outbox (non-blocking)
  CL->>NET: frame(stroke.point, seq, timestamp_ns)
  NET->>PC: bytes (any chunking)
  PC->>PC: FrameDecoder → MessageCodec.decode (validated)
  Note over PC: receivedAt = host monotonic now<br/>pen→host = receivedAt − (t − clockOffset)
  PC->>MAIN: delegate (DispatchQueue.main)
  MAIN->>MAIN: PeerArbiter.isActive? → StrokeIngestor (seq de-dup) → StrokeStore.append
  MAIN->>OV: setNeedsDisplay(dirty rect of new segment)
  OV->>OV: draw cached ink + live stroke
  Note over OV: receive→draw measured here;<br/>compositor + panel scan-out add ≤ 1 frame
